&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;CXK7dYEX2oV8HkxU4j4l6H67gte&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXK7dYEX2oV8HkxU4j4l6H67gte&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independent Non-Executive Director (Resident), Seychelles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg5StmAulyHgQQoM93RCuBng&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg5StmAulyHgQQoM93RCuBng&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OKX&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgHoGClAXTrmMgeyZusko4Gd&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom. OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves. Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er. OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgAqDtTET7TuPTXV02Vha5Lf&quot;&gt;Our Seychelles business has operated since 2017 and now sits within the licensing regime established by the Virtual Asset Service Providers Act of Seychelles 2024 (the VASP Act). We are seeking an Independent Non-Executive Director, resident in Seychelles, to join the board of our Seychelles entity to supplement its board of governance with an independent resident non-executive director.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg287J6nHZnhz3VutVEoqjOd&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgPATDTgepvmmTjUjXpIKHXf&quot;&gt;As an Independent Non-Executive Director and Resident Director of our Seychelles entity, you will bring independent challenge to strategy, risk and conduct, hold management to account on behalf of shareholders and stakeholders, and provide the resident board presence that the licence and the entity&#39;s governance arrangements require. The role exists to do three things at once: provide independent challenge; satisfy the Seychelles Financial Services Authority (the FSA) that the board of the Company meets its expectations on composition, competence and fitness and propriety under the VASP Act; and provide local substance in Seychelles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgbUmQmXJWpF0O11JHcEy5Pe&quot;&gt;The entity operates within the group&#39;s global governance, risk and compliance framework while remaining separately accountable to its own board and to its regulator. The Board comprises a mix of executive and independent non-executive directors. This is a genuinely resident role. The appointee must be physically present in Seychelles, attend board and management meetings in person, and be available to engage with the FSA and the entity&#39;s advisers in Seychelles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg77s0WZpNaVTQ183iH83ORs&quot;&gt;A non-executive director carries the same general legal responsibilities to the entity as any other director, and must perform those duties faithfully, efficiently and diligently to a standard commensurate with the role and with their own knowledge, skills and experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgbj5RDQeRnW6ExKOtglEwfe&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgQ8x3ZjZsSAzpOCE4Xhkymf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independentally Challenge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlglyAcU2UqtXDiKVoLjVKVHf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bring an external and independent perspective to strategy, risk and conduct, and hold management to account on behalf of shareholders and stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgzx2rTJ6fjJ46f3NJAgFBKh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Provide constructive challenge and strategic guidance, and offer specialist advice to the Board.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgBdMbV8pIYz63HrHrAyyD8g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Scrutinise the performance of management and of individual executive directors against agreed goals, and monitor how that performance is reported.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgK4H9ktooGvNu2vSxWits2e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act in good faith, honestly and responsibly, and make decisions objectively in what you consider to be the interests of the entity.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgsJqu3i5ss6q7KvfMNgWhUb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory Standing &amp;amp; Local Substance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgY4rl71gLL8C6nlEiovOTkh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Satisfy the FSA that the board of the Company meets its expectations on composition, competence and fitness and propriety under the VASP Act.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgizEdzOyrgPOVpAVStajqWb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Provide the physical, resident board presence in Seychelles that the licence and the entity&#39;s governance arrangements require.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgMyAHwSLzfexYM8NjQEU2dg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Attend board and management meetings in person, and engage with the FSA and the entity&#39;s advisers in Seychelles as required.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgVU2ZLREsJyYJPxJ62L2Arc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collective Board Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgRTw3jsLzxuUrpE1wM2vdwe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Promote the long term sustainable success of the entity, generating value for shareholders and contributing to wider society.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgNutcrs9PV6Xc7pp54N1Nub&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Establish the entity&#39;s purpose, values and strategy, and satisfy the Board that its culture is aligned to them.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgx3urua9LkFb4eVMPlS93gc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Provide effective, prudent and ethical oversight, act with integrity, lead by example and promote the desired culture.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgSaMgxzg5yWHokTnBJovd5b&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ensure the resources needed to meet the entity&#39;s objectives are in place, and measure performance against them.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgHkte8lmhHdu7fAHYnyyeYe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Establish and lead within a framework of prudent and effective controls that allows risk to be assessed and managed.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg4iPHQNFpgCgKDUkNVsFiWf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ensure effective engagement with shareholders and stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgJzNKyNXxC6xNgqvRnw5hPR&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ensure workforce policies and practices are consistent with the entity&#39;s values.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgGA7mD4VLWHEAHIa4B5CqEd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Director Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgmDzAFiA7cknOXS0EFvuGHo&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Satisfy yourself on the integrity of the entity&#39;s financial information, its financial controls, and whether its risk management systems are robust and defensible.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg53gKZEswo0IuuG5tQziyld&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Determine appropriate remuneration for executive directors, and play a leading part in appointing and, where necessary, removing them.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgGiSuclffhBndSK0IUajYuc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Contribute to the entity&#39;s succession planning.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgrKXtOcvVIdFh7a9RrLORwf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Uphold the highest standards of integrity, and support the chairperson in setting the values, behaviours and culture of the boardroom and beyond.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlghfuugqI6S9DovsOgzpZcrc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Committee Service&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgyvAlpnW8N2Ap3zRvRn2fse&quot;&gt;Serve on one or more board committees where required. The relevant terms of reference will be provided on appointment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgXDPTwxBTE8iQVibq4UNNIc&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What We Look for in You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgkSbVCtjW0JW3QiQfyMYOVb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Resident in Seychelles, and currently holding the right to reside and work there.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgCp3EpezLYwRPrf67VVQtTb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
