&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgZnCVYETzozLd3wkcRWyCRb&quot;&gt;The Fiat team builds the money experiences of OKX. Beyond the payment rails — fiat deposits, withdrawals, and payment methods across 100+ markets — we own Simple Buy/Sell, the front door to crypto for both onshore and offshore markets, and Cards &amp;amp; Pay, the products taking OKX into the money app category and giving customers a whole new reason to connect with us. We sit inside the Bay Area AI-Native Product &amp;amp; Engineering Center: we don&#39;t just use AI tools, we build agent harnesses, evaluation pipelines, and automation that lets a small team ship like a large one. We&#39;re looking for a front-end engineer who is sharp, curious, data-driven, and believes most &quot;impossible&quot; things simply haven&#39;t been automated yet.&lt;/div&gt;
