&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JDbbden4EoR2l0xavSyuBkHKsQf&quot;&gt;The operations function at OKX is responsible for the overall day to day running of the local business. We&#39;re a team of risk-minded problem solvers helping to grow the business in a sustainable and compliant manner.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gwy7dDC43o8lWbxDF8Fu6owQsJb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-Cegcd6GmzozJQBxwESju2zs7s1e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LP0kduRe0oRoSbx25rHu7M56szg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Working with the Head of Operations to execute business strategies in alignment with team and company priorities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SuYVde0JoocJ4VxMZ8PuuadqsIc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Driving improvements and optimisations across Product, Compliance, Customer Support &amp;amp; Growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B8GRdLS8aooaizxSec8uDnr0sVe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Be able to understand and interpret data and draw actionable insights.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
